OL,3,AColombian police storm supermarket to
OL,4,Afree 20 held hostage for 17 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FColombian security forces have freed
OL,7,Faround 20 shoppers and employees who
OL,8,Fhad been held hostage for about 17
OL,9,Fhours at a supermarket in the city of
OL,10,FCartagena.
OL,12,FGunmen had stormed into the building at
OL,13,F08:00 (13:00 GMT) on Tuesday after what
OL,14,Flocal media said was a failed attempt
OL,15,Fof robbing an armoured car carrying
OL,16,Fmoney and valuables.
OL,18,FThey held those inside at gunpoint
OL,19,Fwhile trying to negotiate their
OL,20,Fgetaway.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
