OL,3,AColombian police storm supermarket to
OL,4,Afree 20 held hostage for 17 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith the situation becoming ever more
OL,7,Fintense as the day progressed,
OL,8,FColombian President Abelardo de la
OL,9,FEspriella gave the green light for
OL,10,Fspecial forces and police to launch a
OL,11,Fdaring operation to free the hostages,
OL,12,Fin which one gunman was killed.
